    "title": "RecovR: Vehicle Theft Recovery",
    "description": "A new vehicle is a big investment - one that everyone wants to protect - but vehicle theft is on the rise. By buying the RecovR vehicle locator from your dealer and downloading this powerful app, you will be able to find your vehicle if it\u2019s stolen and communicate its location quickly and easily to law enforcement, check if your vehicle has been towed, find your vehicle if you forgot where you parked, locate a tardy teenager who\u2019s missed curfew, or lock your vehicle to a specific location and be notified if it\u2019s ever moved. Ask your favorite dealer for RecovR today.",
